  "description": "Bright & Spacious 2-Bedroom Apartment to Rent, Rathcoole, €2,200/month\n\nAvailable immediately, Minimum 12-month tenancy\n\nA bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment is available to rent in Rathcoole, Dublin 24.\n\nThe property offers a generous open-plan living and dining area with large windows providing excellent natural light and plenty of space for comfortable living and entertaining.\n\nPlease note: The property has only recently been furnished and some of the furniture is currently in transit. The apartment will be fully furnished as described above, and updated photographs will be added as the remaining furniture arrives.\n\nProperty features\nTwo-bedroom apartment\nSpacious open-plan living and dining area\nLarge windows and excellent natural light\nFully furnished\nFully equipped kitchen\nWashing machine/dryer\nDining table and chairs\nCoffee table and TV unit\nOutdoor space\nPrivate parking\nOil heating\nBER C1\nWell-maintained residential development\n\nExcellent Rathcoole location\n\nThe property is ideally located in Rathcoole, with a range of local amenities close by, including supermarkets, shops, cafés, restaurants, a gym and other everyday conveniences.\n\nThere are also excellent transport links, with:\n\n69 and 126 bus routes nearby\nSaggart Luas stop approximately 2.5km away\nApproximately 45–60 minutes to Dublin city centre\nConvenient access to the M7/N7 and surrounding areas\n\nRental details\n\nRent: €2,200 per month\nDeposit: €2,200\nAvailability: Immediately\nMinimum tenancy: 12 months\nBills: Not included\nParking: Available\nFurnished: Yes\n\nPlease get in touch with some information about yourself, your intended move-in date and the length of time you are looking to rent and a viewing can be arranged.",
